 599:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu_IntrinsicsGcc.h **** /**  Write back and invalidate cache address \"p\" and return post incremented
 600:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu_IntrinsicsGcc.h ****  * value of \"p\". Generates CACHEA.WI [Ab+].
